<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan cuts ProSource.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan cuts ProSource.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said analyst John Renwick downgraded ProSource Inc to neutral from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3-3/4 to 8-7/8.</p>
<p>-- the food service distributor said late Monday it expected second quarter quarter earnings to fall below last year's levels.</p>
